From e908703a555563206968fb1fa53fdab7bc426dec Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xavier509 <xavier.neil@yahoo.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 11:33:19 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Forex desk (Sterling + Pip) on a free OANDA practice account,
 same strict path as crypto

- trader/oanda.py: candles, pricing, market orders with SL/TP attached, trade sync, weekend rules
  (no entries after Friday noon NY, flat by Friday 4pm), practice-only unless live is double-confirmed
- Shorts as flipped '_SHORT' twins so the simulator/brains/shadow test stay long-only; one position per
  pair everywhere (simulator slots, shadow test, live) as US accounts can't hedge
- FX features: multi-horizon returns, EMAs, volatility, tick volume, USD strength index, USD side,
  session/day cycles, SPY last session; weekly stretches so no simulated trade crosses a weekend
- Strict path generalized (validation + final exam + shadow test + clearance/revoke) for crypto & forex;
  lab boosts both while in training with a warm worker pool per desk
- Studio: forex desk in the lab, dashboard card, chat rules, report line; manager/challenger fixes

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
